START
  ↓
Input sorted array
  ↓
Input search element
  ↓
low = 0, high = n - 1
  ↓
low <= high?
 ├── NO → Element Not Found → END
 ↓ YES
mid = low + (high-low)/2
  ↓
A[mid] == key?
 ├── YES → Element Found
 │          ↓
 │       Print Index
 │          ↓
 │         END
 └── NO
      ↓
key < A[mid]?
 ├── YES → high = mid - 1
 └── NO  → low = mid + 1
             ↓
       Back to low <= high?